    "closes": [
      "complete",
      "fail",
      "continue_as_new",
      "cancel"
    ],
    "note": "A select() loser the workflow never awaits is still open when the run closes. Completing, failing or continuing as new records ActivityCancelled (or TimerCancelled) for it in the closing transaction, before the terminal event, and cancels its task; cancel already did. Nothing is appended after the terminal event, a late claim or outcome is refused with run_closed, and the closed run replays to the same close."
  },
